{ "content": "Acho que fez a verificação errada encontrei diversos erros de typescript \nSeguindo o padrao do projeto analisando modulos concluidos me ajude a resolver `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/src/core/establishment/` `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/src/core/musician/` `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/src/core/audience/` \nAlem de analisar modulos concluidos analisa o `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/prisma/schema.prisma` `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/Docs/Features-SoundMeet.md` para melhor \ncontexto e entendimento \n\n1- `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/src/core/gamification/infra/db/prisma/badge-prisma.repository.ts` \nClass 'BadgePrismaRepository' incorrectly implements interface 'IBadgeRepository'.\n  Type 'BadgePrismaRepository' is missing the following properties from type 'ISearchableRepository<Badge, BadgeId, BadgeFilter, BadgeSearchParams, BadgeSearchResult>': findAll, getEntityts(2420)\n\nArgument of type '{ points: number; created_at: Date; id: string; name: string; description: string; icon: string; category: string; requirement: JsonValue; rarity: string; isActive: boolean; }' is not assignable to parameter of type 'BadgeModelProps'.\n  Property 'is_active' is missing in type '{ points: number; created_at: Date; id: string; name: string; description: string; icon: string; category: string; requirement: JsonValue; rarity: string; isActive: boolean; }' but required in type 'BadgeModelProps'.ts(2345)\nbadge-model-mapper.ts(12, 3): 'is_active' is declared here.\n\nObject literal may only specify known properties, but 'is_active' does not exist in type 'BadgeWhereInput'. Did you mean to write 'isActive'?ts(2561)\n\n\n2- `/home/wesleyr10/Programação/Projetos/SoundMeet/soundmeet-backend/src/core/gamification/infra/db/prisma/ranking-prisma.repository.ts`